{
  "_comment": [
    "Next-word frames for a personal model that hasn't learned anything yet",
    "(§18.2 — v1 ships no bigram asset). Without these the prediction bar is",
    "empty until the user has spoken a few messages, which reads as broken.",
    "",
    "Hand-written around AAC core frames rather than corpus-derived: these are",
    "the sentence starts core vocabulary is designed to produce. Arrays are in",
    "descending preference order — position is the only ranking signal, so keep",
    "the most likely continuation first and keep each list short.",
    "",
    "Personal bigrams outrank these as soon as the user has any, so a wrong",
    "guess here decays out of the way rather than sticking."
  ],
